          %p
            Discussion of pairs of commuting cohesive structures (such as the combination of real cohesion and equivariant relevant for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+cohomology"} differential
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orbifold+cohomology"} orbifold cohomology
          %ul
            %li#MyersRiley23
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Jaz+Myers"}> David Jaz Myers
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mitchell+Riley"} Mitchell Riley
              %em Commuting Cohesions
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.13780"}> arXiv:2301.13780
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Exposition in:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Jaz+Myers"}> David Jaz Myers
              ,
